{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And they passed a voice through the camp.</b> And they proclaimed, like 'passing before HaShem' (מעבירים עם ה'). From here our Rabbis said to prohibit carrying from domain to domain on the Sabbath. And its derivation is העברה העברה — from the verse about Yom HaKippurim it is written here 'ויעבירו קול במחנה,' and it is written there 'והעברת שופר תרועה' — just as there the day is forbidden, so here the day is forbidden." "<b>Let them not do any more work.</b> And it is written, 'ויכלא העם מהביא' — from here our Rabbis supported [the ruling] that bringing [an object] is a melakhah."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:02:04.469975954Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}